Overview

At Vipto, we respect every user's privacy and their right to control their personal information. If you no longer wish to use the Vipto Seller application, you may request the deletion of your account and associated data at any time.

This page explains how to request account deletion, what information is deleted, what information may be retained, and how long any retained information is kept.

How to Request Account Deletion

To request deletion of your Vipto Seller account, please send an email to:

Email: vipto.app@gmail.com

Use the subject line:

Account Deletion Request

To help us identify your account, include the following information in your email:

Your registered phone number

Your name (if available)

Your shop name (if applicable)

Any additional information that helps us locate your account

We may contact you if additional verification is required to ensure that the request is made by the account owner.

What Data Will Be Deleted

Once your request has been verified and processed, we will permanently delete the personal data associated with your Vipto Seller account, including, where applicable:

Seller account information

Name

Registered phone number

Shop information

Shop address

Uploaded product listings

Product images

Store profile information

Product availability requests associated with your seller account

Other information stored specifically for operating your seller account

After deletion, your account will no longer be accessible.

Data That May Be Retained

Certain information may be retained only when required for legal, security, fraud prevention, dispute resolution, or regulatory compliance purposes.

Examples may include:

Server logs

Security records

Information required to comply with applicable laws

Records necessary to investigate misuse or fraudulent activity

Any retained information will only be kept for the minimum period required by applicable law or legitimate business obligations.

Processing Time

We aim to process verified account deletion requests within 30 days of receiving all necessary information.

Processing time may vary if additional verification is required.

Effect of Account Deletion

Deleting your account is permanent.

After your account has been deleted:

You will no longer be able to access the deleted account.

Your seller profile will be removed.

Your uploaded products will no longer be available through the platform.

Your shop information will no longer appear within the application.

Deleted information cannot be recovered.

If you wish to use Vipto Seller again in the future, you will need to create a new account.

Requesting Deletion of Specific Data

At this time, Vipto Seller does not support deleting individual pieces of account data while keeping the account active.

To remove your personal information from our platform, please request complete account deletion using the process described above.

Contact Us

If you have any questions regarding account deletion, privacy, or data handling, please contact us at:

Email: vipto.app@gmail.com

We will make reasonable efforts to respond to your inquiry as quickly as possible.

Updates to This Policy

This Account Deletion Policy may be updated periodically to reflect improvements to our services, legal requirements, or privacy practices. The latest version published on this page will always apply.

